      "user_id": 0,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087809000000
    },
    {
      "text": "Thank you for holding. My name is Sarah. How can I help you today?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087817266666
    },
    {
      "text": "I have an order number, 774-B-91. I need to return an item. Just tell me if I can do it.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35686,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087821866666
    },
    {
      "text": "Certainly, let me pull that up for you. One moment... Okay, I see the order. This is regarding the V-Aero helmet?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087827933332
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, the helmet. Can I return it or not? Simple question.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35686,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087835666665
    },
    {
      "text": "Yes, you absolutely can. I see it was delivered 27 days ago, and that item falls within our 10-day return window. Was there a specific issue? For instance, was it the wrong color, or did you have a safety concern?",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087839666665
    },
    {
      "text": "The color is wrong. It was a gift. The box is unopened, it's brand new.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35686,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087854066665
    },
    {
      "text": "Not a problem at all. I have processed the return for you. I am emailing you a prepaid return label right now. Since you're a VIP member, I've also waived any potential restocking fees and added a complimentary $15 credit to your account for your next purchase.",
      "speakerId": "AGENT",
      "role": "AGENT",
      "user_id": 303,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087858999998
    },
    {
      "text": "Okay. That's fine. Thank you.",
      "speakerId": "CUSTOMER",
      "role": "CUSTOMER",
      "user_id": 35686,
      "start_timestamp_usec": 1769087876599998
